       # platform/edge/require-registry-host.yaml is the guard that stops the class returning.
+      # idp#1030 named the registry and the pull still failed, because the name was never the
+      # fault. The literal kubelet event, read off the pod on 2026-08-31: 'toomanyrequests: You
